  "body": "## What changed\r\n\r\n- Move `Planner::core_spiral` and `Planner::orbit` unchanged into private `adaptive/core.rs`, together with their local trial alias and front threshold. Only the moved methods gain `pub(super)` visibility; shared step/round limits, public types and the planning/refusal orchestration stay in the parent.\r\n- Reflow three `lift.rs` doc comments only. Its executable statements and provenance are unchanged; this does not implement #982.\r\n- Add the per-issue decision/preservation record. No algorithms, tolerances, diagnostics, test cases, dependencies, changelog or goldens change.\r\n\r\nAll 30 files under `adaptive/` are now at most 400 lines: `mod.rs` 344, `core.rs` 98, `lift.rs` 400 (maximum 400).\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\nValidated on Windows against base `a6bd69d8527e0752cc58e6a02c1dae4971355268`, frozen tree `b24e175fbe51e79a54a4d8042ec92a3ea19a649a`. Final commit `85076f40f3567f0525293aaa48b4b280bb41b373` has exactly that tested and independently reviewed tree.\r\n\r\nUsed the `work-issue` targeted-binaries + Clippy alternative to the quick gate:\r\n\r\n```text\r\ncargo test -p camcraft-motion --lib --test adaptive_band --test adaptive_hsm --test adaptive_orbit_seam --test pocket3d_hsm\r\ncargo clippy -p camcraft-motion --all-targets -- -D warnings\r\n```\r\n\r\n- Tests: **197 passed, 0 failed, 7 ignored** (motion lib 190 passed/1 ignored; mapped integration binaries 7 passed/6 ignored).\r\n- Clippy: exit 0, no warnings. `git diff --check`: clean.\r\n- Complete moved definitions match the pinned base after the two required visibility changes. An inverse-wiring comparison proves the remaining parent source is unchanged; `lift.rs` non-comment source is identical.\r\n- Motion inventory remains **762 `#[test]` and 48 `#[ignore]`**. All **193 tracked golden/snapshot blobs** are unchanged. No dedicated 2D Adaptive output golden was found; this is source/blob preservation, not a claim of an unexecuted heavy output regeneration.\r\n- Independent review of the exact frozen tree found no actionable issues.\r\n\r\nExisting coverage includes the planar adaptive band, HSM report/default case, entry-orbit seam and 3D pocket HSM cases, plus the unchanged adaptive unit tests. No layout-only test or manufactured behavioral regression was added to this mechanical refactor.\r\n\r\n## Not exercised\r\n\r\nIgnored heavy/release tests, full-workspace/app/UI campaigns, runtime golden-output regeneration, and graphify (not available in the development environment). The automatic `cargo xtask gate quick` command was not run; the explicit manual alternative above was. Hosted checks are expected to be absent under the repository's local-gates policy; no workflow was dispatched.\r\n\r\nChangelog: none (behavior-preserving refactor)\r\nEffort: high (safety floor; no escalation)\r\n\r\nFixes #851\r\n",
